{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Adventures of Badgersaw Chapter 1 is a short RPG filled with British banter and scary monsters. Slap your teammates to recover MP as you uncover the mystery of an alien cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Badgersaw, who has taken a wrong turn and now he and his companions are lost. Lead the gang out of this mess or perish to the dark forces lurking within the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badgersaws' companions include the wizard Mr L (who denies the existence of Magic) and the ranger Tantalum (Badgersaw\u2019s motivationally challenged friend).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/546abc2389bac7fe31e33a266a26a2e3.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/b3b03faf412f5a747fcb8166d9d8ec2e.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5ecfccc7dbdc147077e0c5715e1a105b.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Fight and Talk your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is hybrid of old school adventure titles, visual novels and JRPGs. Explore the cavern, solve its puzzles, fight its monsters and talk to its denizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/6879012a053aba60b6fdd89ae3c6d3b6.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Motivate your team to victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the three main characters has a unique resource instead of traditional MP which is tied to their personality. Badgersaw has malice, Tantalum has motivation, and Mr L has mana (because he's a wizard).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badgersaw can slap Tantalum to restore his motivation in a daring show of leadership. For some reason, this also works on Mr L.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.poster.avif?t=1759715251\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.webm?t=1759715251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.mp4?t=1759715251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, the party will unlock items,\u00a0equipment and new abilities to allow players to customize the protagonists' combat roles and develop a unique play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed with caution, as death is everywhere. Each death also gives you a unique scene, so you can have fun dying, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.poster.avif?t=1759715251\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.webm?t=1759715251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.mp4?t=1759715251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 is about 3-4 hours of content on the main quest with an extra hour or so of sidequests and hidden content. New chapters will be released as DLC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore MP by slapping your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss mortality with a meat golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sandwiches from a child's lunchbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the protagonists slowly lose hope as they get lost in an increasingly strange &amp; hopeless environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in banter to lighten the mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the terrors and escape (maybe)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One of the main mechanics of Chapter 1 is managing limited heals and saves. There are enough oppourtunities to do both to get you to the end of the chapter, but some players may find this challenging.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340220?t=1759715251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759715251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/79e9d52e6b4b7289c46cd18af47f37f5c16d2b53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759715251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/79e9d52e6b4b7289c46cd18af47f37f5c16d2b53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759715251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The Adventures of Badgersaw frequently makes use of dark topics for comedic effect, including Torture, Amputation and Alcohol and Drug use.\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3342160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Adventures of Badgersaw Chapter 1 is a short RPG filled with British banter and scary monsters. Slap your teammates to recover MP as you uncover the mystery of an alien cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Badgersaw, who has taken a wrong turn and now he and his companions are lost. Lead the gang out of this mess or perish to the dark forces lurking within the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badgersaws' companions include the wizard Mr L (who denies the existence of Magic) and the ranger Tantalum (Badgersaw\u2019s motivationally challenged friend).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/546abc2389bac7fe31e33a266a26a2e3.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/b3b03faf412f5a747fcb8166d9d8ec2e.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5ecfccc7dbdc147077e0c5715e1a105b.avif?t=1759715251\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Fight and Talk your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is hybrid of old school adventure titles, visual novels and JRPGs. Explore the cavern, solve its puzzles, fight its monsters and talk to its denizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/6879012a053aba60b6fd